        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Client as 🏢 Client\n    participant FE as React PostJob\n    participant AI as AiController\n    participant SVC as AiService\n    participant GEM as 🤖 Gemini API\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;+FE: Click \&quot;AI Soạn JD\&quot;\n    FE-&gt;&gt;+AI: POST /api/ai/job-assistant {title, description}\n    AI-&gt;&gt;+SVC: improveJobPost(request)\n    SVC-&gt;&gt;+SVC: buildJobPrompt() → Vietnamese\n    SVC--&gt;&gt;-SVC: prompt\n    SVC-&gt;&gt;+GEM: POST generateContent {thinkingBudget:0}\n    Note over GEM: Phân tích &amp; tối ưu&lt;br/&gt;~3-5 giây\n    GEM--&gt;&gt;-SVC: Raw JSON text\n    SVC-&gt;&gt;+SVC: cleanJson() + parseJobResponse()\n    SVC--&gt;&gt;-SVC: JobPostAiResponse\n    SVC--&gt;&gt;-AI: JobPostAiResponse\n    AI--&gt;&gt;-FE: 200 OK {improvedTitle, skills, budget, tips}\n    FE-&gt;&gt;FE: Auto-fill all form fields\n    FE--&gt;&gt;-Client: Show AI tips panel ✅\n    Client-&gt;&gt;+FE: Review &amp; submit POST /api/jobs\n    FE--&gt;&gt;-Client: Job created&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="lCrRU7iMGGIK8T2wCj79-64">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
